"Dome orbits: drag across to turn it, up or down to raise or lower the camera. Front looks ahead from behind the listener, Top from above, Side from the right, Iso from an isometric corner; dragging in Front, Top or Iso carries on from there. Scroll or pinch to zoom; double-click to return to the default view." = "穹顶视图可环绕：左右拖动旋转，上下拖动升降视角。前置视角从听者身后向前看，俯视从上方，侧视从右侧，等轴从等轴测的角度；在前置、俯视或等轴视角中拖动，会从该视角继续环绕。滚动或双指捏合可缩放；双击回到默认视角。";
