"Front view" = "前置视角";
"Grid" = "网格";
"Highest frequency" = "最高频率";
"How close the camera is to the listener. Also with the scroll wheel or a pinch over the dome." = "相机与听者的距离。也可在穹顶上滚动滚轮或双指捏合。";
"How long a faint afterglow of recent energy lingers after the release; 0 turns it off." = "释放之后，近期能量的淡淡余辉停留多久；0 表示关闭。";
"How much of each image's predicted width is drawn: 1 as wide as it is heard, from its energy vector after Frank 2013 (an in-phase phantom between speakers 60° apart about 36°, one speaker 10.7°), 0 every image as compact as one speaker, 2 twice as wide. Energy that cancels between speakers spreads wider still." = "绘制每个声像预测宽度的多少：1 按其被听到的宽度绘制，依据 Frank 2013 由能量矢量求得（相距 60° 的两只扬声器之间的同相幻象约 36°，单只扬声器为 10.7°）；0 将每个声像画得与单只扬声器一样紧凑；2 画成两倍宽。在扬声器之间相互抵消的能量铺展得更宽。";
"How readily speakers that share coherent energy form one image between them. Coherence is measured from the speakers' smoothed cross-spectra and corrected for chance; higher sensitivity lets weaker coherence form images, lower keeps only strongly shared signals together. The analysis uses it (in the plugin, too)." = "共享相干能量的扬声器之间形成同一声像的难易程度。相干度由扬声器的平滑互谱测得，并校正了偶然相关；灵敏度越高，较弱的相干也能成像，越低则只有强烈共享的信号才会合在一起。分析过程会使用此设置（插件中也是）。";
