"This plugin sends no spatial field, so the nebula shows each channel's band energy at its speaker only. Install the plugins of this build for coherent images." = "此插件不发送空间场，因此星云只在各扬声器处显示各声道的频段能量。请安装本版本的插件以显示相干声像。";
