"Level floor" = "电平下限";
"How much the body covers what lies behind it." = "能量体遮盖其后方内容的程度。";
"How quickly the body grows toward a new level." = "能量体向新电平扩张的速度。";
"How quickly the body shrinks when the level drops." = "电平下降时能量体收缩的速度。";
"How much every lobe is widened beyond the width it is predicted to be heard at, so the body reads as one mass (degrees at half maximum). At 30°, two uncorrelated speakers 60° apart still show as two lobes, while one coherent image between them shows as one." = "每个波瓣在预测的听感宽度之外再加宽多少，使能量体读作一个整体（半峰全宽，单位为度）。在 30° 时，相距 60° 的两只不相关扬声器仍显示为两个波瓣，而它们之间的一个相干声像显示为一个波瓣。";
"The LFE channel's level as the arc around the listener, on the body's scale: it has no direction, so it never shapes the body. Low frequencies in the full-range channels stay where those channels are." = "LFE 声道的电平显示为听者周围的弧线，与能量体同一刻度：它没有方向，因此从不改变能量体的形状。全频声道中的低频仍留在这些声道所在的位置。";
"The hemisphere's grid and the level rings on the floor, every 20 dB, labelled in dBFS." = "半球网格与地面上的电平环，每 20 dB 一环，以 dBFS 标注。";
"The level at the listener, where the body's radius starts: quieter energy reaches no radius. The speakers' shell is 0 dBFS." = "听者处的电平，即能量体半径的起点：更安静的能量不形成半径。扬声器所在的球壳为 0 dBFS。";
"Frequency" = "频率";
"Frequency colors the full band by the bands heard from each direction, warm bass through cool treble: near the listener every audible band mixes, toward white for broadband sound, and toward the edge only the loudest bands remain. Theme draws it in the palette's color. A split into 3 or 5 bands always shows each band in its own color." = "“频率”按每个方向听到的各频段为全频段着色，低音偏暖、高音偏冷：靠近听者处所有可闻频段相互混合，宽带声音趋近白色；越靠近边缘，只剩下最响的频段。“主题”使用调色板的颜色。分为 3 或 5 个频段时，每个频段始终以自身的颜色显示。";
"Grain" = "颗粒";
"A fine, still grain in the glow, like the window's film grain. It moves only with the body." = "辉光中细腻而静止的颗粒，如同窗口背景的胶片颗粒。它只随形体移动。";
"Colored by frequency, a point of the body wears the hues of the bands that are at least that loud in its direction: the edge shows what dominates each direction, the core what all of them share." = "按频率着色时，形体上的每一点都带有在其方向上至少有那么响的频段的色相：边缘显示每个方向中占主导的频段，核心显示所有频段共有的部分。";
"centre %@" = "中心 %@";
"Its color shows the frequencies heard from each direction: near the listener every band mixes toward white, near the edge only the loudest bands remain, warm for bass and cool for treble." = "其颜色显示从每个方向听到的频率：靠近听者处所有频段混合并趋近白色，靠近边缘处只剩最响的频段，低音偏暖、高音偏冷。";
