"%@: the distance must be between 0.1 and 100 m." = "%@：距离必须在 0.1 到 100 m 之间。";
"%@: the elevation must be between −90° and 90°." = "%@：仰角必须在 −90° 到 90° 之间。";
"A layout file is JSON: the channel format, the mapping and each speaker's role, azimuth, elevation and distance (null when unknown), in the listener's frame (x right, y front, z up)." = "布局文件为 JSON：声道格式、映射方式，以及每只扬声器的角色、方位角、仰角与距离（未知时为 null），坐标以听音位置为原点（x 向右、y 向前、z 向上）。";
"Applying the speaker layout: what was analysed with the previous one is not drawn." = "正在应用扬声器布局：用先前布局分析的内容不会绘制。";
"Azimuth" = "方位角";
"Azimuth in degrees clockwise from the front (left is negative), elevation in degrees up from the ear plane (below it negative), distance in meters from the listening position; leave the distance empty when it is not known. Routing (which input feeds which speaker) stays in Settings ▸ Channels." = "方位角以度为单位，从正前方顺时针计（左侧为负）；仰角以度为单位，从耳朵所在平面向上计（其下为负）；距离以米为单位，从听音位置计；不知道距离时请留空。路由（哪路输入馈送哪只扬声器）仍在“设置 ▸ 声道”中设置。";
"Channel format" = "声道格式";
"Channel format %@ is not one Auraliscope shows." = "Auraliscope 不显示声道格式 %@。";
"Custom %@" = "自定义 %@";
"Distance" = "距离";
"Done" = "完成";
"Duplicate" = "复制";
"EDIT" = "编辑";
"Each particle is a place where a band's frequencies sit in the newest analysis: at the centre of gravity of the speakers, weighted by each frequency's amplitude in each (for one sound panned with gains, the direction of its velocity vector). A sound only one speaker carries sits at that speaker; one panned between speakers sits on the line between them where its gains put it, at every frequency; two sounds sharing a band each keep their own place; sound the speakers carry independently scatters along the lines between them. Neighbouring frequencies at one place share a particle. Energy that cancels between speakers is tinted ochre where it sits. A description of how the feeds share the signal, not a measured sound field or source distance; speakers stand where the speaker layout puts them (the standard one puts every height at 45 degrees). Hover over a particle to read its frequency, level and what places it there." = "每个粒子是最新一次分析中某个频段的频率所在的一个位置：各扬声器的重心，按每个频率在各扬声器中的幅度加权（对于一个以增益声像定位的声音，即其速度矢量的方向）。只有一只扬声器承载的声音位于该扬声器处；在扬声器之间声像定位的声音，在每个频率上都位于其增益决定的连线位置；同一频段中的两个声音各自保持自己的位置；各扬声器独立承载的声音沿扬声器之间的连线散开。位于同一位置的相邻频率共用一个粒子。在扬声器之间相互抵消的能量在其所在位置染为赭色。这描述的是馈送信号如何在扬声器之间分配，并非测得的声场或声源距离；扬声器位于扬声器布局所设的位置（标准布局把所有顶部扬声器放在 45 度）。将指针悬停在粒子上，可读取其频率、电平以及使它位于该处的成分。";
"Elevation" = "仰角";
"Export…" = "导出…";
"File" = "文件";
"How many particles a band keeps per analysis frame (30 a second) on average: the analysis gathers a band's frequencies that sit at one place into one particle, keeps every place that carries a good share of the band's energy, and gathers the weakest rest; bands with more detail (the treble's) get what simpler ones leave. Fewer particles never dim the picture or move a band's centre: its light and its centre of gravity stay the same." = "每个频段每个分析帧（每秒 30 次）平均保留的粒子数：分析会把一个频段中位于同一位置的频率合为一个粒子，保留每个承载频段较大能量份额的位置，并把最弱的其余部分归并；细节更多的频段（高频）会得到较简单频段用不完的份额。粒子减少既不会让画面变暗，也不会移动频段的中心：其光量与重心保持不变。";
"Import…" = "导入…";
"Included" = "参与";
"LAYOUT" = "布局";
"Left out (not in %@): %@." = "已略去（不属于 %@）：%@。";
"Left to right" = "从左到右";
"Mirror" = "镜像";
"Name" = "名称";
"No direction: shown as the arc around the listener, never placed." = "没有方向：显示为听者周围的弧线，从不放置。";
"PREVIEW" = "预览";
"Preview" = "预览";
"Raw observations" = "原始观测";
"Rename…" = "重命名…";
"Restore" = "恢复";
"Right to left" = "从右到左";
"SPEAKERS" = "扬声器";
"Spatial energy body of the speaker feeds. Its radius in each direction is the level heard from there, from %@ dBFS at the listener to 0 dBFS at the speakers, not a distance. Energy several speakers carry coherently points between them; energy out of phase is tinted ochre. Speakers stand where the speaker layout puts them (the standard one puts every height at 45 degrees)." = "扬声器馈送信号的空间能量体。它在每个方向上的半径是从该方向听到的电平，从听者处的 %@ dBFS 到扬声器处的 0 dBFS，并非距离。多只扬声器相干承载的能量指向它们之间；反相的能量染为赭色。扬声器位于扬声器布局所设的位置（标准布局把所有顶部扬声器放在 45 度）。";
"Speaker" = "扬声器";
"Speaker Layout" = "扬声器布局";
"Speaker directions" = "扬声器方向";
"Speaker directions: each frequency at the centre of gravity of the speakers' directions, weighted by its amplitude in each, every speaker on the unit sphere (as in build 97). The radius is part of that average, not a distance." = "扬声器方向：每个频率位于各扬声器方向的重心，按它在每只扬声器中的幅度加权，所有扬声器都在单位球面上（与 build 97 相同）。半径是这一平均值的一部分，并非距离。";
"Speaker layout" = "扬声器布局";
"Speaker layout preview" = "扬声器布局预览";
"Speaker positions" = "扬声器位置";
"Speaker positions need every included speaker's distance." = "使用扬声器位置需要每只参与的扬声器的距离。";
"Speaker positions: each frequency at the centre of gravity of the speakers' positions in meters, weighted by its amplitude in each. It shows how the feeds share the signal out over this layout; it is not a measured source position or distance. Every included speaker needs its distance. The Level body keeps the speakers' directions: its radius is the level." = "扬声器位置：每个频率位于各扬声器实际位置（以米计）的重心，按它在每只扬声器中的幅度加权。它显示馈送信号如何在这一布局上分配，并非测得的声源位置或距离。每只参与的扬声器都需要距离。电平能量体仍使用扬声器方向：其半径是电平。";
"Standard %@" = "标准 %@";
"Standard placements" = "标准位置";
"Standard places for: %@." = "以下采用标准位置：%@。";
"The body shows how loud the speaker feeds are heard from each direction: its radius is the level in dBFS (the rings on the floor), not a distance. Energy only one speaker carries points at that speaker. Energy several speakers carry coherently points between them, where its phantom image is heard: along their velocity vector below about 700 Hz and their energy vector above (Gerzon), as wide as the energy vector predicts it is heard (Frank). Energy that cancels between speakers has no stable direction: it spreads wide and is tinted ochre. An estimate from the feeds, not a measured sound field; speakers stand where the speaker layout puts them (the standard one puts every height at 45 degrees). Hover over the body to read a direction's level and what forms it." = "能量体显示从每个方向听到的扬声器馈送信号有多响：它的半径是以 dBFS 计的电平（地面上的环），并非距离。只有一只扬声器承载的能量指向该扬声器。多只扬声器相干承载的能量指向它们之间、其幻象声像被听到的位置：约 700 Hz 以下沿其速度矢量，以上沿其能量矢量（Gerzon），宽度为能量矢量预测的听感宽度（Frank）。在扬声器之间相互抵消的能量没有稳定的方向：它扩散得很宽，并染为赭色。这是根据馈送信号的估算，并非测得的声场；扬声器位于扬声器布局所设的位置（标准布局把所有顶部扬声器放在 45 度）。将指针悬停在能量体上，可读取某个方向的电平及其构成。";
"This file is not an Auraliscope speaker layout." = "此文件不是 Auraliscope 扬声器布局。";
"This layout was saved by a newer Auraliscope (format version %d)." = "此布局由较新版本的 Auraliscope 保存（格式版本 %d）。";
"This plugin could not use your speaker layout, so the dome shows the standard layout." = "此插件无法使用你的扬声器布局，因此穹顶显示标准布局。";
"This plugin places sound with the standard speaker layout (it is older than build 98), so the dome shows the standard layout. Install the plugins of this build to use your speaker layout." = "此插件按标准扬声器布局放置声音（它早于 build 98），因此穹顶显示标准布局。请安装本版本的插件以使用你的扬声器布局。";
"Where each speaker sits around the listening position (azimuth, elevation and, if known, distance), for the dome and its analysis, here and in a DAW plugin of this build. The standard layout places the ear layer at 0° and every height at 45°." = "每只扬声器在听音位置周围的位置（方位角、仰角，以及已知时的距离），供穹顶及其分析使用，在本机和本版本的 DAW 插件中都有效。标准布局把耳朵高度的一层放在 0°，所有顶部扬声器放在 45°。";
"no direction" = "无方向";
"unknown" = "未知";
"width %d° (frontal model)" = "宽度 %d°（前方模型）";
"Spatial window" = "空间窗口";
"How long a stretch of sound places the particles. Standard measures every band over the full analysis window: the steadiest placement. Fast measures the bands from 1 kHz up over a quarter of it and those from 4 kHz up over an eighth (about 43 and 21 ms at 48 kHz), so their particles follow moves and onsets sooner, with coarser frequency detail. The analysis uses it (in the plugin, too)." = "决定粒子位置所依据的声音时长。“标准”在完整的分析窗口上测量每个频段：位置最稳定。“快”在其四分之一上测量 1 kHz 以上的频段，在其八分之一上测量 4 kHz 以上的频段（48 kHz 下约为 43 与 21 ms），因此这些粒子更快跟上移动和起音，但频率细节更粗。分析会使用此设置（插件中也是）。";
"Listener" = "听者";
"A head at the listening position, its nose to the front and its ears to the sides, so the dome's front, sides and back read at a glance. Its size is schematic." = "在听音位置显示一个头部：鼻子朝前、耳朵朝两侧，一眼就能看出穹顶的前方、两侧和后方。其大小为示意。";

