"Audio MIDI Setup" = "音频 MIDI 设置";
"Audio MIDI Setup (%@)" = "音频 MIDI 设置（%@）";
"Audio MIDI Setup sets this device's speakers up as %@: unless you route them here, its channels feed those speakers." = "“音频 MIDI 设置”将此设备的扬声器配置为 %@：除非在这里另行路由，它的各声道就送往这些扬声器。";
"Audio MIDI Setup…" = "音频 MIDI 设置…";
"Channel Order" = "声道顺序";
"Film (Pro Tools): L C R Ls Rs LFE…" = "胶片（Pro Tools）：L C R Ls Rs LFE…";
"No speakers are set up for this device in Audio MIDI Setup, so input 1 feeds the first channel in SMPTE order, input 2 the second, and so on. Set them up there (Configure Speakers), or choose a Channel Order." = "此设备未在“音频 MIDI 设置”中配置扬声器，因此按 SMPTE 顺序，输入 1 对应第一个声道，输入 2 对应第二个，依此类推。可在那里配置（“配置扬声器”），或选择一种声道顺序。";
"Pro Tools sends surround in film order (L C R Ls Rs LFE…), not in SMPTE order (L R C LFE Ls Rs…): with SMPTE order its surrounds are shown at the front. Set its speakers up in Audio MIDI Setup or choose Channel Order ▸ Film Order, unless its I/O Setup is remapped, and the format that matches its output bus." = "Pro Tools 以胶片顺序（L C R Ls Rs LFE…）输出环绕声，而不是 SMPTE 顺序（L R C LFE Ls Rs…）：按 SMPTE 顺序，它的环绕声会显示在前方。除非已在其 I/O 设置中重新映射，请在“音频 MIDI 设置”中配置它的扬声器，或选择“声道顺序 ▸ 胶片”，并选择与其输出总线相符的格式。";
"Routes every channel of this format at once: as the device's speakers are set up in Audio MIDI Setup, or in a host's channel order" = "一次路由此格式的所有声道：按设备在“音频 MIDI 设置”中的扬声器配置，或按某个宿主的声道顺序";
"SMPTE / ITU: L R C LFE Ls Rs…" = "SMPTE / ITU：L R C LFE Ls Rs…";
