"Use %@" = "使用 %@";
"VST3 (Nuendo, Cubase): L R C LFE Lrs Rrs Lss Rss…" = "VST3（Nuendo、Cubase）：L R C LFE Lrs Rrs Lss Rss…";

/* Radiant body (build 101) */
"Radiant body" = "辉光能量体";
"Radiant body places sound by" = "辉光能量体放置声音的依据";
"Radiant body draws each band where its frequencies are heard, at the centre of gravity of the speakers that carry them weighted by their level in each, as one glowing body: a centred phantom gathers between L and R, a wide stereo programme stretches along the line between them, and sound all round gathers toward the listener. It glows in the frequencies' hues, burns toward white where it is dense and loud, and swells into haze as it ages. Point lights over it mark exactly where each band's frequencies sit. Level body draws the level heard from each direction as the radius of one body, read on the floor's dBFS rings." = "辉光能量体把每个频段画在其频率被听到的位置，即承载这些频率的扬声器的重心（按各扬声器中的电平加权），合成一个发光的能量体：居中的幻象声像聚在 L 与 R 之间，宽广的立体声节目沿两者之间的连线展开，来自四周的声音向听者聚拢。它以频率的色相发光，密集且响亮处趋向白色，随时间推移散成薄雾。其上的光点准确标出每个频段的频率所在之处。电平能量体则把每个方向听到的电平画成一个能量体的半径，可在地面的 dBFS 圆环上读取。";
"How bright and dense the body glows." = "能量体发光的亮度与密度。";
"How far below the loudest band frequencies still add to the body, in dB: the loudest burn white, quieter ones fade out over this range. How loud the loudest band is sets how dense the whole body is. Hover over the body to read a band's level." = "比最响频段低多少 dB 以内的频率仍计入能量体：最响的烧成白色，较弱的在这个范围内渐隐。最响频段有多响决定整个能量体的密度。将指针悬停在能量体上可读取频段的电平。";
"How large each new particle's light is in the body: larger merges neighbouring places into one mass, smaller keeps them apart." = "每个新粒子的光在能量体中有多大：越大越会把相邻的位置融成一团，越小越能把它们分开。";
"How much light swells as it ages, so older light turns to haze while new light stays compact. 0 keeps it as compact as when it was heard." = "光随时间推移扩散的程度：较旧的光化为薄雾，新的光保持紧凑。0 让它保持被听到时的紧凑。";
"Frequency colors the body by the frequencies heard at each place, warm bass through cool treble: where many bands meet it burns toward a cream-white core, and its fringes show what dominates there. Theme draws it in the palette's color. A split into 3 or 5 bands always shows each band in its own color." = "“频率”按每个位置听到的频率为能量体着色，低音偏暖、高音偏冷：多个频段交汇处趋向乳白色的核心，边缘显示该处占主导的频段。“主题”使用调色板的颜色。分为 3 或 5 个频段时，每个频段始终以自身的颜色显示。";
"Draws the analysis' observations as points instead of the body, for checking where sound is placed: the newest frame only, every point the same small size, without smear, glow or depth shading." = "以点代替能量体绘制分析的观测值，用于检查声音被放在哪里：只显示最新一帧，每个点大小相同且很小，没有拖尾、辉光或深度阴影。";
"How readily speakers that share coherent energy count as one image. In Radiant body it decides what reads as a phantom image or out of phase (the ochre tint and the pointer's reading), not where the body sits: its frequencies' amplitudes decide that. Coherence is measured from the speakers' smoothed cross-spectra and corrected for chance. The analysis uses it (in the plugin, too)." = "共享相干能量的扬声器被视为同一声像的难易程度。在辉光能量体中，它决定哪些能量读作幻象声像或反相（赭色与指针读数），而不决定能量体的位置：位置由其频率的幅度决定。相干度由扬声器的平滑互谱测得，并校正了偶然相关。分析过程会使用此设置（插件中也是）。";
"The quietest band drawn: a band below it adds nothing to the body, whatever the glow range." = "绘制的最安静的频段：低于它的频段无论辉光范围如何都不计入能量体。";
"How long light stays in the body, fading and swelling as it goes; the longer, the more it builds up into a trail of where sound has been." = "光在能量体中停留的时间，期间逐渐淡出并扩散；越长，越会累积成声音经过之处的轨迹。";
"A glowing body of the speaker feeds' frequency bands, each where its band is heard: at the centre of gravity of the speakers that carry it, weighted by its level in each. A centred phantom gathers between two speakers, a wide stereo programme stretches along the line between them, sound all round gathers toward the listener. The loudest band burns white and quieter ones fade out %d dB below it; older light swells into haze. Point lights mark exactly where each band's frequencies sit. Energy out of phase is tinted ochre. Speakers stand where the speaker layout puts them (the standard one puts every height at 45 degrees)." = "由扬声器馈送各频段构成的发光能量体，每个频段位于它被听到的位置：承载它的扬声器的重心，按其在各扬声器中的电平加权。居中的幻象声像聚在两只扬声器之间，宽广的立体声节目沿两者之间的连线展开，来自四周的声音向听者聚拢。最响的频段烧成白色，较弱的在其下 %d dB 处渐隐；较旧的光散成薄雾。光点准确标出每个频段的频率所在之处。反相能量呈赭色。扬声器位于扬声器布局指定的位置（标准布局把所有顶部扬声器放在 45 度）。";
"The body wears the colors of the frequencies at each place, warm for bass and cool for treble; where many bands meet, their light adds up toward white." = "能量体带有每个位置上频率的颜色，低音偏暖、高音偏冷；多个频段交汇处，光叠加趋向白色。";
"This plugin sends no frequencies of its own (before build 87), so Radiant body draws from the spatial field's statistics. Install the plugins of this build to see each frequency where it is heard." = "此插件不发送自己的频率（早于 build 87），因此辉光能量体根据空间场的统计数据绘制。安装此版本的插件即可在每个频率被听到的位置看到它。";
"Points" = "光点";
"How bright the point lights over the body are: each is one place where a band's frequencies are heard, crisp when new and smearing as it ages, so where every band sits can be read exactly. The body dims a little under them, so they carry the brightest light. 0 shows the body alone." = "能量体上光点的亮度：每个光点是一个频段的频率被听到的位置，新出现时清晰，随时间推移拖尾，因此能准确读出每个频段的位置。光点下的能量体会稍微变暗，让光点承载最亮的光。0 只显示能量体。";

